PayDomTest
└── payment requests come from the page, not from us
    ├── given the page published an address
    │   ├── it finds an address the page published
    │   └── it renders a QR and names the rate when it can
    ├── given the page has no address
    │   └── it offers nothing
    ├── given the amount cannot be expressed as a payment request
    │   └── it offers nothing
    ├── given the amount is too large to fit a QR
    │   └── it offers nothing
    ├── given a panel is already open
    │   └── it replaces a previous panel rather than stacking them
    └── when the panel is dismissed
        └── it closes cleanly
